gitkay (0.0.5-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * This fork numbers its own releases from 0.0.1, below the original
    project's 1.x line; the entries below are the original project's.
  * Build-Depends corrected to match the dependency tree (no GTK, graphene,
    OpenSSL or cmake) and rustc raised to the version edition 2024 and
    let-chains actually require.

